ff is A\u2019s leadership and technical foresight versus his show\u2011off/closed\u2011mind behavior, compared with C\u2019s crew\u2011building strengths offset by communication and ego issues, and the more overt interpersonal deficits of B and D.\n**Remaining uncertainty:**\n- How severe A\u2019s show\u2011off and resistance to new ideas are in practice \u2013 whether they translate into rigidity or crew friction on extended flights.\n- The practical impact of C\u2019s communication difficulties and egocentric attitude on real\u2011time crew coordination.\n**What would change my vote:**\n- Concrete evidence that A\u2019s closed\u2011mind/show\u2011off behavior leads to unsafe rigidity or crew breakdowns.\n- Credible, specific examples showing C\u2019s communication problems or ego causing crew\u2011coordination failures that outweigh his reliability and calmness.\n- Strong, corroborated evidence that B\u2019s or D\u2019s interpersonal issues are minor or can be mitigated while their technical advantages are decisive.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate A\"}"}
