ths and displays hostile remarks plus weak numeric memory.\n- **Candidate\u202fD** is technically competent and responsible, but his hot temper and arrogant, know\u2011it\u2011only attitude pose clear risks to crew cohesion.\n**Main trade\u2011off:** Whether A\u2019s leadership and anticipatory skills outweigh his show\u2011off/closed\u2011mind traits, versus C\u2019s crew\u2011oriented strengths offset by communication and egocentric weaknesses. The interpersonal drawbacks of B and D appear more directly detrimental to crew morale and safety.\n**Remaining uncertainty:**\n- How severe A\u2019s show\u2011off behavior and resistance to new ideas are in practice \u2013 do they lead to rigidity or crew friction on extended flights?\n- The practical impact of C\u2019s communication difficulties and egocentric attitude on crew coordination and safety.\n**What would change my vote:**\n- Concrete evidence that A\u2019s closed\u2011mind or show\u2011off behavior results in unsafe rigidity, crew breakdowns, or missed safety opportunities.\n- Credible, specific examples showing that C\u2019s communication problems or egocentric attitude have caused crew\u2011coordination failures or safety\u2011critical errors that outweigh his reliability and calmness.\n- Strong, corroborated evidence that another candidate\u2019s interpersonal issues are minor or can be mitigated while their technical advantages are markedly superior (e.g., that B\u2019s remarks are isolated and his technical expertise is essential).\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate A\"}"}
