d is described as arrogant, with a hot temper and a know\u2011it\u2011only attitude.\n**Main trade\u2011off**\nCandidate\u202fC offers the most balanced package of reliability, crew\u2011building presence, calm judgment, and technical foresight. His weaknesses (communication difficulty and egocentricity) are less concretely documented than the overt hostility or temper issues of the other candidates.\n**Remaining uncertainty**\nThe practical severity of C\u2019s communication difficulties and egocentric attitude: whether they could lead to misunderstandings that affect safety or crew coordination on long flights.\n**What would change my vote**\n- Concrete evidence that C\u2019s communication problems or ego have caused crew\u2011coordination failures or safety\u2011critical errors.\n- Credible, specific evidence that Candidate\u202fA\u2019s leadership and anticipatory abilities outweigh his show\u2011off/closed\u2011mind behavior, or that any other candidate\u2019s interpersonal flaws are minor while their technical strengths are decisive.\n**Confidence**: moderately high (\u2248\u202f75\u202f%) that Candidate\u202fC is the best overall fit given the current evidence.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
